{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach, grab and check object properties, otherwise move to nearest object and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToNearestObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
